@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000

### 1. Registrar al Enfermero Martín Torres (De la HU 1.1 de Enfermería)
POST {{baseUrl}}/iam/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Martín Torres",
  "email": "martin.torres@hospital.com",
  "passwordPlain": "enfermeria123",
  "role": "NURSE"
}

### 2. Registrar un Recepcionista (Para Admisión)
POST {{baseUrl}}/iam/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Recepcionista Guardia",
  "email": "recepcion@hospital.com",
  "passwordPlain": "recepcion123",
  "role": "RECEPTIONIST"
}

### 3. Hacer Login y obtener el JWT
# @name loginNurse
POST {{baseUrl}}/iam/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "martin.torres@hospital.com",
  "passwordPlain": "enfermeria123"
}

### 3.1 Hacer Login y obtener el JWT
# @name loginRecep
POST {{baseUrl}}/iam/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "recepcion@hospital.com",
  "passwordPlain": "recepcion123"
}

### ---pruebas billing module---

### ==========================================
### MÓDULO 1: IAM (IDENTIDAD Y ACCESOS)
### ==========================================

### 1. Registrar un Administrador
POST {{baseUrl}}/iam/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fullName": "Director Administrador",
  "email": "admin@hospital.com",
  "passwordPlain": "admin123",
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### 2. Hacer Login y guardar el Token en una variable temporal
# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/iam/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@hospital.com",
  "passwordPlain": "admin123"
}

### ==========================================
### MÓDULO 6: FACTURACIÓN Y FINANZAS
### ==========================================

### 3. Cargar precio de un insumo en BD (Requiere token de ADMIN)
POST {{baseUrl}}/billing/prices
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{loginAdmin.response.body.accessToken}}

{
  "itemName": "Ibuprofeno 400mg",
  "unitPrice": 500
}

